      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "For reference, here you can find the CoB PCBs for run1: https://github.com/wafer-space/chip-on-board-wire-bonded-pcbs/tree/main/run-1\n\nAs for the main PCB, Mike created a version for the 1x0p5 CoB: https://codeberg.org/rebelmike/ws01-tinyQV-mobo-alpha",
